{"3669820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CatchMaker", "steam_appid": 3669820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/b9d9722e9193ca3cda95e126c0519a50.poster.avif?t=1786030539\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/b9d9722e9193ca3cda95e126c0519a50.webm?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/b9d9722e9193ca3cda95e126c0519a50.mp4?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Gotcha! It's a Rockroach!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CatchMaker</strong> is a soothing bug-catching and matching adventure. Meet a quirky cast of friendly locals and explore a world buzzing with adorable little critters. Help the island’s residents restore balance to its unique ecosystem while uncovering the secrets of your own past and embracing your destiny. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/237ffcbb7c00cbed663f43d847209ce7.avif?t=1786030539\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/69f04cc92bb4d80015dba384b6283851.poster.avif?t=1786030539\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/69f04cc92bb4d80015dba384b6283851.webm?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/69f04cc92bb4d80015dba384b6283851.mp4?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Oops! You scared it away! Maybe try a different approach next time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Sillypedes to Rockroaches, the island is teeming with a colorful menagerie of critters. Observe them to learn their habits and catch them to complete your Field Guide. Approach them carefully, use clever lures, or try to chase them down with your net; it's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/eb313b3916123ac28fbfc7d89ddf2304.webp?t=1786030539\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/39727dcd8d47fba4f72870f78913e1ee.poster.avif?t=1786030539\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/39727dcd8d47fba4f72870f78913e1ee.webm?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/39727dcd8d47fba4f72870f78913e1ee.mp4?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>These two seem to have caught the love bug!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to a diverse selection of randomly generated species and variants. Assume your role as the bugs’ love doctor, find out what they are aching for, and set up the perfect romantic evening! Every date reveals more about a bug's ideal partner helping you get closer to finding their soulmate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/bce55c7a42de1e83840a1cff95d86ae6.webp?t=1786030539\" width=511 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/262f8273bdab56bed3058e4193382b77.poster.avif?t=1786030539\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/262f8273bdab56bed3058e4193382b77.webm?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/262f8273bdab56bed3058e4193382b77.mp4?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>So much to see!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the sun‑kissed beaches, trek the hilly meadows, stargaze from the cliffs, or simply hang out with the villagers. CatchMaker lets you pause the romance, soak in the scenery, and return to bug‑whispering whenever you’re ready.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/b9d9722e9193ca3cda95e126c0519a50.poster.avif?t=1786030539\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/extras/b9d9722e9193ca3cda95e126c0519a50.webm?t=1786030539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669820/